# 5. Local Workspaces, Staging & Ingestion Snapshots
artifacts/
**/artifacts/
repo_workspaces/
**/repo_workspaces/
staging_snapshots/
**/staging_snapshots/
scratch/
**/scratch/
tmp/
**/tmp/
temp/
**/temp/

# 6. Database & Local Storage Files
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.dump

# 7. Archives & Compressed Uploads
*.zip
**/*.zip
*.tar
**/*.tar
*.tar.gz
**/*.tar.gz
*.tgz
**/*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z

# 8. Logs & Diagnostic Dumps
*.log
logs/
